Here is a complete, self-contained HTML5 Snake game. You can save this code as an `.html` file (e.g., `snake.html`) and open it in any modern web browser.

### Features:
- **Classic Gameplay**: Eat food to grow, avoid walls and your own tail.
- **Controls**: Arrow keys or WASD.
- **Score Tracking**: Current score and high score (stored in `localStorage`).
- **Game Over Screen**: With a restart button.
- **Responsive Design**: Works on desktop and mobile (touch controls added via on-screen buttons for mobile users).

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HTML5 Snake Game</title>
    <style>
        body {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background-color: #2c3e50;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            color: #ecf0f1;
            margin: 0;
        }

        h1 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #2ecc71;
        }

        .game-container {
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        canvas {
            display: block;
            background-color: #34495e;
        }

        .score-board {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            width: 400px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 1.2em;
        }

        .controls {
            margin-top: 20px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 50px);
            grid-template-rows: repeat(2, 50px);
            gap: 5px;
        }

        .btn {
            background-color: #34495e;
            border: none;
            color: white;
            font-size: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #2ecc71;
        }

        .btn:active {
            background-color: #27ae60;
        }

        .up { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; }
        .left { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 2; }
        .down { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2; }
        .right { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 2; }

        .game-over {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            display: none;
            width: 80%;
        }

        .game-over h2 {
            color: #e74c3c;
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        .game-over button {
            background-color: #2ecc71;
            border: none;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .game-over button:hover {
            background-color: #27ae60;
        }

        @media (min-width: 600px) {
            .controls {
                display: none; /* Hide touch controls on desktop */
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Snake Game</h1>
    <div class="score-board">
        <span>Score: <span id="score">0</span></span>

